      "year": 2002,
      "abstract": "This paper describes the tests undertaken to determine the dipole moments of a magnetic torquer rod. Test methodology, experimental setups, and test results are presented in detail. The dipole moments of the torquer rod are determined by using different experimental setups and are also compared with those provided by the manufacturer of the devices. Certain setups would yield satisfactory results while others would not. The factors that have major effects on the magnetic field of the torquer rod are discussed based on our experiments.",
